              "text": "engatar — \"to put into gear; to hook up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ele engata a primeira e o carro começa a andar. He puts it into first gear and the car starts to move."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Engatar a marcha atrás — to put it into reverse. You also engatar a trailer to a car."
            }
          ]
        },
