          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of engatar is not settled. It is usually linked with gato, which also meant 'hook, clamp'; gato is inherited from Late Latin cattus (EtymDB)."
            }
